## 🏛️ 代码组织

### 核心架构

#### 服务层
- [hybrid_driver/server.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/server.py) - 支持WebSocket的FastAPI服务器
- [hybrid_driver/main.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/main.py) - 服务入口点和初始化

#### 设备管理
- [hybrid_driver/device_pool.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/device_pool.py) - 设备池管理和生命周期
- [hybrid_driver/device/](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/device) - 设备抽象
  - [hybrid_driver/device/device.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/device/device.py) - 基础设备接口
  - [hybrid_driver/device/android_device.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/device/android_device.py) - Android实现

#### 操作系统
- [hybrid_driver/operation.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/operation.py) - 操作执行和管理
- [hybrid_driver/driver.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/driver.py) - 驱动抽象层

#### WebDriver实现
- [hybrid_driver/webdriver/](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/webdriver) - WebDriver实现
  - [hybrid_driver/webdriver/base.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/webdriver/base.py) - 基础WebDriver接口
  - [hybrid_driver/webdriver/selenium_executor.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/webdriver/selenium_executor.py) - Selenium实现
  - [hybrid_driver/webdriver/appium_executor.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/webdriver/appium_executor.py) - Appium实现
  - [hybrid_driver/webdriver/web_executor.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/webdriver/web_executor.py) - Web自动化
  - [hybrid_driver/webdriver/popup_handler.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/webdriver/popup_handler.py) - 弹窗处理
  - [hybrid_driver/webdriver/wait_utils.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/webdriver/wait_utils.py) - 等待工具
  - [hybrid_driver/webdriver/webdriver_utils.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/webdriver/webdriver_utils.py) - WebDriver工具

#### 配置管理
- [hybrid_driver/config/](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/config) - 配置管理
  - [hybrid_driver/config/settings.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/config/settings.py) - 应用设置
  - [hybrid_driver/config/log_config.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/config/log_config.py) - 日志配置
- [config/](mdc:spot_light/config) - 项目配置文件

#### 工具和助手
- [hybrid_driver/utils/](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/utils) - 工具模块
  - [hybrid_driver/utils/logger.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/utils/logger.py) - 日志工具
- [hybrid_driver/collect/](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/collect) - 数据收集模块

### 代码组织原则
1. **关注点分离**：每个模块都有特定的职责
2. **抽象层**：组件之间有清晰的接口
3. **配置集中化**：所有设置都在 [hybrid_driver/config/](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/config) 中
4. **工具组织**：通用工具在 [hybrid_driver/utils/](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/utils) 中
5. **测试组织**：测试在 [tests/](mdc:spot_light/tests) 中镜像源代码结构

### 模块依赖
- [hybrid_driver/server.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/server.py) 依赖于 [hybrid_driver/device_pool.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/device_pool.py)
- [hybrid_driver/device_pool.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/device_pool.py) 依赖于 [hybrid_driver/device/](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/device)
- [hybrid_driver/operation.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/operation.py) 依赖于 [hybrid_driver/webdriver/](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/webdriver)
- 所有模块都使用 [hybrid_driver/config/settings.py](mdc:spot_light/hybrid_driver/config/settings.py) 进行配置

